note ftxsend: the plain-text response of a kind-0 page, same status and security headers
fn ftxsend cs edit ulong 320 io edit uchar 131072 st ulong l ulong to long
n = ftxrun cs io l 0
r = hrspst cs io st
r = hfe r fhdrt cs io tfnctype tftxct
r = hfe r fsechdr cs io
r = hfe r fhdrt cs io tfncc tfnostor
r = hfe r hhend cs io 0 ulong n
r = hfe r ftxrun cs io l 1
ret hfe r hwfin cs io
end
note ftxcode: inside a pre block or inline code
fn ftxcode to bool
if ne get ftxs 1 0
ret true
end
ret ne get ftxs 6 0
end
